0b  the vertical-profile family and the DiskMass constant k
    rho(z) = rho_0 sech^(2/n)(n z/(2 h_z)) has, in closed form,
        k = (2/n) (sqrt(pi)/2) Gamma(1/n) / Gamma(1/n + 1/2)
             n         shape   k numeric    k exact   L=int u w du
             1        sech^2     2.00000    2.00000         2.7726
             2          sech     1.57080    1.57080         1.8319
            10  intermediate     1.13231    1.13231         1.1470
         20000   exponential     1.00007    1.00007         1.0001
    sech^2 -> k=2 exactly, sech -> k=pi/2=1.5708, n->inf -> k=1.
    DiskMass adopt k=1.5.  k enters sigma_z^2 LINEARLY and spans a
